<Positioned left="1008" top="432" width="240"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">(2,2) 入口 → (12,3) 结构剧场</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1276" top="432" width="170"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">13 步 / 26 m</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="457" width="240"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">(12,3) 结构剧场 → (12,13) 作品巡览</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1276" top="457" width="170"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">10 步 / 20 m</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="482" width="240"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">(12,13) 作品巡览 → (23,15) 出口</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1276" top="482" width="170"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E293BFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">13 步 / 26 m</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1006" top="515"><Text fontSize="22" color="#0B1220FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">校验</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="541" width="508"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">可走格 337 个全部可从入口到达，不可达 0 个；</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="565" width="508"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">每一步都是上下左右跨 1 格，无对角、无穿墙；</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="589" width="508"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">门洞位置与宽度取自 floor.txt，未做任何扩大；</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="613" width="508"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">墙格恒为灰色，路线不覆盖格号、不把墙变成可走；</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="637" width="508"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">两路线均按要求先经过 B 再经过 D。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1006" top="669"><Text fontSize="22" color="#0B1220FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">折返说明</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="695" width="508"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">B(12,3) 是 (12,4) 走廊上的支线格，进出必然折返一次；</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="719" width="508"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">36 步解满足「每段最短」，折返位置已记在 paths.json；</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1008" top="743" width="508"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">无折返的简单路径需要 38 步（多 2 步），故未采用。</Text></Container></Positioned>
